{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-26T19:31:19.209Z","data":{"text":"Done. Task 3 is implemented and both verifies pass.\n\n**Summary of changes (all within scope):**\n\n- `src/core/vcs/vcs.ts` — added `show(ref, path)` and `worktreePrune()` to the `Vcs` port.\n- `src/core/vcs/git-vcs.ts` — implemented both directly (`git show <ref>:<path>` with null on miss; `git worktree prune` throwing git's combined output), leaving `git-vcs-write.ts` untouched.\n- `src/core/vcs/no-vcs.ts` — `show` returns null, `worktreePrune` rejects naming the git-off reason.\n- `src/core/spec/approve-worktree.ts` — exported the existing `runPrepare` step.\n- `src/core/vcs/worktree-recreate.ts` (new) — `recreateWorktrees` prunes gone worktree records once, re-adds and prepares each missing `osq/` branch whose tip holds `.run/approved`, returns log lines, and is a no-op under `NoVcs` or `vcs.enabled` off.\n- `src/cli/watch.ts` — runs `recreateWorktrees` before `startWatcher` and logs each line.\n- `tests/vcs-write.test.ts` — added only `show` and `worktreePrune` to `PORT_MEMBERS`.\n- `tests/vcs-worktree-recreate.test.ts` (new) — 7 tests covering `show`, `worktreePrune`, deleted/removed worktree recreation (task runs in the recreated worktree), archived-change and flag-off non-recreation, and the `NoVcs` no-op.\n\n**Verify results:** task verify `node --import tsx --test tests/vcs-worktree-recreate.test.ts` → 7/7 pass; proposal `pnpm verify` → exit 0. Result written to `openspec/changes/093-run-in-worktree/.run/results/3.md`."}}
